The shape of the hollow wood, the physical tension of the steel string, the exact angle

37:58.080 --> 38:00.340
your finger bends the string against the fret.

38:00.420 --> 38:01.160
It all matters.

38:01.560 --> 38:06.760
The physical manipulation of the material literally changes the math of the sound wave in real time.

38:07.200 --> 38:08.780
